    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> as <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;